# welcome-loop-switch (H10): the sin x switch's fade and draw-on inside the
# loop, h3's switch-frames shape. The switch flips at loop frame 106 =
# 4416.67 ms loop time; the port and the reference both cross it on the 4432
# frame (16.67 + 276 * 16), so a wait of 4432 after the click lands the f0
# shot on the reset curves (old whole, new at draw 0). Model:
# f0 reset (x2 whole fading, sinx draw_to 0); f83 old alpha ~0.48, new barely
# started (~0.003); f450 old gone, draw_to 0.5; f1000 switch done, sinx whole.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 104 48
wait 4432
shot loop-switch-f0
wait 83
shot loop-switch-f83
wait 367
shot loop-switch-f450
wait 550
shot loop-switch-f1000
